    req:statement "Applies to instances of asref:CoordinateReferenceSystem; objects of asref:groundControlPointCRS, asref:hasCRS. A coordinate reference system is a resource (an IRI or a blank node), not a literal. Each focus node is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). asref:coordinateEpoch takes at most one value; each is an xsd:decimal literal. asref:crsIdentifier takes at most one value; each is an IRI. asref:wktString takes at most one value; each is an xsd:string literal at least 1 character long."@en ;
