    req:requirementId "req-shape-asref-CoefficientVectorShape" ;
    req:fromStandard "Hexplain Aspect — Spatial Reference (hx-spatialref)" ;
    req:statement "Applied through references from other shapes. A coefficient vector is an RDF list (an IRI or a blank node), not a literal. A conforming value is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). Each member of the list is a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). A coefficient vector must be a well-formed finite RDF list of exactly 20 cells."@en ;
    req:discrepancyType req:Semantic ;
    dcterms:references asref:CoefficientVectorShape .
