    req:fromStandard "Hexplain Aspect — Spatial Reference (hx-spatialref)" ;
    req:statement "Applies to instances of asref:CubicRationalTransform; objects of asref:hasRationalTransform. A cubic rational transform is a resource (an IRI or a blank node), not a literal. Each focus node is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). asref:heightOffset takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). asref:heightScale takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite) greater than 0. asref:latitudeOffset takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). asref:latitudeScale takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite) greater than 0. asref:lineDenominator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:lineNumerator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:lineOffset takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). asref:lineScale takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite) greater than 0. asref:longitudeOffset takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). asref:longitudeScale takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite) greater than 0. asref:polynomialBasis takes exactly one value, an IRI. asref:sampleDenominator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:sampleNumerator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:sampleOffset takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite). asref:sampleScale takes exactly one value, a finite number (an xsd:double or xsd:float literal, not NaN or infinite) greater than 0."@en ;
