    req:statement "Applies to subjects using asref:coordinateEpoch, asref:epsgCode, asref:footprintWKT, asref:gcpIdentifier, asref:gcpPixelX, asref:gcpPixelY, asref:gcpX, asref:gcpY, asref:gcpZ, asref:heightOffset, asref:heightScale, asref:latitudeOffset, asref:latitudeScale, asref:lineOffset, asref:lineScale, asref:longitudeOffset, asref:longitudeScale, asref:originLatitude, asref:originLongitude, asref:originX, asref:originY, asref:sampleOffset, asref:sampleScale, asref:scaleX, asref:scaleY, asref:skewX, asref:skewY. asref:coordinateEpoch takes an xsd:decimal literal (rdfs:range xsd:decimal). asref:epsgCode takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger). asref:footprintWKT takes a geosparql:wktLiteral or xsd:string literal (rdfs:range: their union). asref:gcpIdentifier takes an xsd:string literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). asref:gcpPixelX takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:gcpPixelY takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:gcpX takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:gcpY takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:gcpZ takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:heightOffset takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:heightScale takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:latitudeOffset takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:latitudeScale takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:lineOffset takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:lineScale takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:longitudeOffset takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:longitudeScale takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:originLatitude takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:originLongitude takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:originX takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:originY takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:sampleOffset takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:sampleScale takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:scaleX takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:scaleY takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:skewX takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float). asref:skewY takes an xsd:double or xsd:float literal (rdfs:range xsd:double or xsd:float)."@en ;
