    req:statement "Applies to subjects using dlv:cellBitWidth, dlv:cellBitWidthFromExpression, dlv:chunkSize, dlv:chunkSizeFromExpression, dlv:dimensionSize, dlv:dimensionSizeFromExpression, dlv:dimensionStride, dlv:dimensionStrideFromExpression. dlv:cellBitWidth takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger). dlv:cellBitWidthFromExpression takes a HEL expression, an xsd:string or bddo:HelExpression literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). dlv:chunkSize takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger). dlv:chunkSizeFromExpression takes a HEL expression, an xsd:string or bddo:HelExpression literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). dlv:dimensionSize takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger). dlv:dimensionSizeFromExpression takes a HEL expression, an xsd:string or bddo:HelExpression literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). dlv:dimensionStride takes a positive integer (rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger). dlv:dimensionStrideFromExpression takes a HEL expression, an xsd:string or bddo:HelExpression literal (rdfs:range xsd:string)."@en ;
    req:discrepancyType req:Syntactic ;
    dcterms:references dlv:RangeDatatypeShape .
