    req:requirementId "req-shape-hxf-NativeFunctionShape" ;
    req:fromStandard "Hexplain SPARQL function library (hxf)" ;
    req:statement "A native function reaches the bytes of an asset, so it can fail to answer in ways a pure function cannot, and a caller reading an unbound result needs to know which outcomes are described and which are defects. Every native function must therefore either state a condition under which it yields no value or declare itself total. This does not narrow the library-wide failure contract, which still applies to all of them."@en ;
    req:discrepancyType req:Semantic ;
    dcterms:references hxf:NativeFunctionShape .
